<title>USA: Colt Telecom sells $175 mln units.</title>
<headline>Colt Telecom sells $175 mln units.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following unit offering from Colt Telecom Group was priced on December 9, 1996, via Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Each unit consists of one senior discount note (face value</p>
<p>of $1,000) and one warrant.</p>
<p>BORROWER COLT TELECOM GROUP</p>
<p>AMT $175 MLN	 COUPON 12 PCT     MATURITY 12/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE SR DISC NOTES ISS PRICE 558.75  FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/06</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S NA    YIELD  12 PCT YTM PAY FREQ NA</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P NA	  SPREAD		CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1662</p>
